# W7e, guest b (k10): on matz02 with a; when a drops at the barrier b goes on into stag0102 at once.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@100
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log b joined a
route {route:stag0101_west}
mat matz02 yes 2 until stage=stag0102,control
log b in stag0102
# (Round I1b's integration, run r3: when a's BARRIER reached the relay before the cut, the barrier was a sealed NEW of
# both and b's engine has a's slot from the load on, so present=2 held at once and b left before a came back. b stays
# until a's empty slot is gone (the relay's snapshot hash wait, 60 s) and a is back.)
wander 330 140 15 until epoch>=@300 fail stage=stagml11
wander 330 140 15 until present=2,sealed>=900 fail stage=stagml11
log a is back with b
